egulator of the ER-associated degradation pathway (ERAD) of misfolded proteins. It competes with AMFR/gp78 for binding VCP/p97, and inhibits AMFR/gp78-VCP/p97 complex formation that is required for degradation of ERAD substrates (PubMed:17872946). Involved in the regulation of adrenal cortisol and dehydroepiandrosterone (DHEA) biosynthesis (PubMed:35042898)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}